{{ range .Deployments }}| `{{ .Repo }}` | `{{ .Tag }}` | {{ range $i, $n := .Namespaces }}{{ if $i }}, {{ end }}{{ $n }}{{ end }} | {{ range $i, $a := .Accounts }}{{ if $i }}, {{ end }}{{ $a }}{{ end }} |
{{ end }}
{{ end -}}
{{ .WorkloadCount }} workload(s) affected. Rows are ordered by how far through an environment sequence they look, which is a guess from the account and namespace names.

**Why this is prioritised**

